  "comment": "NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Super VL 120B-A12B (Mamba-2 + attention hybrid MoE), NVIDIA's NVFP4 weights, text only, on one B300 (288 GB) with the vLLM 0.32.0 release image. Prefix caching for the hybrid model needs --mamba-cache-mode align. Variants: base (none), fast (async scheduling + FlashInfer Mamba kernel), mtp1 / mtp3 (fast + the model's multi-token prediction head), mtp1-fp16 (mtp1 + FP16 Mamba state with stochastic rounding, lower precision). Up to about 128 long agent conversations use mtp1; 128 to 200 use fast (full precision) or mtp1-fp16.",
